      "unresolved_alternatives": "The observations explicitly admit uncertainty about whether the object was created as 'one thing' or 'assembled from multiple components' (q2-undetermined) and note that finer craftsmanship cannot be determined (v9-o4). While the text leans heavily toward a single carved piece, it does not definitively rule out complex assembly techniques that mimic monolithic carving."
    }
  ]
}

