      "unresolved_alternatives": "It remains possible that there are internal seams where the folds were made, but observation img-k7-o3 describes an unadorned section as having 'no visible pores or seams,' which suggests a high level of integration. However, the existence of such perfect monolithic carving cannot be fully confirmed without seeing the underside of every fold."
