      "unresolved_alternatives": "The observations mention uncertainty regarding whether the object was assembled from multiple components (img-q2-undetermined) or if details are original patina vs. oxidation (img-v9-undetermined). While the visual evidence points to carved stone, it cannot definitively rule out a composite construction where individual folded parts were attached later, even if they look seamless."
